; AurumFunded - FTMO 1-Step Challenge: 10% target, 3% daily loss, 10% maximum loss trailing the end-of-day balance,
; Best Day rule 50% (rules from 2026 reviews - verify on ftmo.com; one review gives a 6% maximum loss, which would need
; InpPropMaxStopPct 4.5 instead). EA day stop 2% (x1.2 slip stays inside the 3%), final stop 1.5% inside the trailing
; line. tools/prop_ftmo_1step.py at 70% of the edge: first payout median 7.8 months, none failed (also at half the
; edge). Load on a gold chart of the FTMO account. Inputs not listed keep the EA's defaults.
InpPropTargetPct=10.0
InpPropRound=1
InpPropMinDays=4
InpPropDayStopPct=2.0
InpPropMaxStopPct=8.5
InpPropTrailing=true
InpPropRoomPct=8.5
InpPropCap=1.4
InpPropResetHHMM=100
InpEuClock=true
InpSizeMult=0.5
InpGridRiskPct=0.0
InpHoldVolPct=0.0
InpPropFast=false
